{{en-noun}}

# The act of one who [[proceed]]s, or who prosecutes a design or transaction; progress or movement from one thing to another; a measure or step taken in a course of business; a transaction; as, an illegal proceeding; a cautious or a violent proceeding.
#: '' The proceedings of the high commission.'' --[[w:Macaulay|Macaulay]].
